{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "nav",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Camera｜结构图\n箭头按标签表示调用、持有、数据输出或继承。[[Camera/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机.canvas|主流程]]。\nPyrios 当前显式关闭额外横移；右侧 Query 为独立只读观察。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1410,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "pawn",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`DefaultCameraMode: TSubclassOf<UGGYGOCameraMode>` → 角色／形态的默认模式类。\nDA_Pawn_Pyrios 配置 Pyrios 参数蓝图。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 210,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ga",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\n`SetCameraMode(Class)` → 原 Hero 的 Spec／generation。\n`ApplyCameraOffset(Offset)` → 先 Clear 再 Set。\n保存原接收者和有效 token，不重找新 Avatar。\n`CleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination`\nContext → 摘原匹配成员、归还原精确凭证。\n派生能力归还自己的资源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|AbilitySystem]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 285,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "hero",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent\n`DetermineCameraMode()` → 覆盖类／默认类。\n`SetAbilityCameraMode(Class,Spec)` → 代次。\n`ClearAbilityCameraMode(Spec,generation)` → 撤销。\n`ConsumeLocalCameraProviderReady(Pawn,Entry)`\n原身份 Ready → Activate；重复不 Restart。\n镜头结果与输入结果分开。\n`ConsumeLocalAbilitySystemNotice`\n原订阅／typed H → 清原归属资源，保护后继。\nEndPlay 归还自身资源、解绑模式委托。\n[[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|Input 原 H 合同]]\n[[Camera/结构#解绑协调与后继保护|解绑边界]]",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 360,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "component",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraComponent\n`PrepareCameraView` → 单次求值、Result + Prepared。\nPrepared 的 `TryGetCandidateView` → 只读候选。\n`CommitPreparedCameraView` → 消费候选并写原对象；\n复核上下文，不再求值；失败不发布成功输出。\n兼容 `GetCameraView` 复用同一核心，不以 Super 兜底。\n`ReinitializeCameraEvaluation` → 显式重建 Stack/池；\n保留覆盖与 Offset 凭证，不求值、不发布。\nQueryCameraMode(精确 Class) → 同次只读 Observation。\nOffset：合法 Set 才替换/发号；Clear 仅当前 token。\nReset 清运行状态，序号不重置。\n持有 Stack/Offset/唯一碰撞恢复比例；\n每次求值在 Offset 后至多一次 ECC_Camera。",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 350,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "third",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraMode_ThirdPerson\nUpdateView(dt) → Result／View／Request。\nPyrios 当前显式关闭：清本人侧移，继续原构图。\n可选启用时：原 CMC → 外侧投影／滤波，只合成 TargetOffset.Y。\n原旋转／FOV／请求保持；不查询 World。\n[[Camera/模式栈实现#ThirdPerson 的 WalkRun 构图响应|可选算法与清理]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 740,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 235,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "pyrios-mode",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## BP_CameraMode_ThirdPerson_Pyrios\n`/Game/Camera/Modes/BP_CameraMode_ThirdPerson_Pyrios`\n当前 bEnableWalkRunSteeringOffset=false。\n原构图／FOV／穿墙和旧 Steering 参数保留。\nDA_Pawn_Pyrios 选类；继承 ThirdPerson。\n[[Camera/结构#设计参数与碰撞策略的归属|配置归属]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1000,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "mode",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraMode\n`UpdateCameraMode(dt)` → Result。\n校验 dt／配置，清旧 Request → `UpdateView(dt)` → Result。\n派生成功并复核 View 后才推进 Alpha／Weight；Failure 原样传播。\nGetCameraModeView → View；\nGetCameraPenetrationRequest → Request。\nGetTargetActor → 原 CameraComponent 目标。",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 275,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "stack",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraModeStack\n`PushCameraMode(Class)` → Result，复用并置顶。\n空/非法类明确失败，不继续旧栈。\n`EvaluateStack(dt, OutView, OutRequest)` → Result；\n只有完整成功才提交两项输出。\n持有实例池/活动栈；按可见贡献聚合。\n`ClearStack()` → 清活动栈，保留实例池。\n不持有 Ability Spec；[[Camera/模式栈实现|实现说明]]。",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 660,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 275,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "view",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## FGGYGOCameraModeView\n`Location` / `Rotation` → 镜头位置和画面朝向。\n`ControlRotation` → 输入所用控制朝向。\n`FieldOfView` / `Blend(Other, Weight)` → 视场角和加权合成。",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 980,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "controller",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## AGGYGOPlayerCameraManager / NativeCache\n持久 POV：引擎当前／上一帧 Cache。\nManager 持有准入、原身份和确认资格。\n`ActivateCameraEvaluation(Target,Component)` → Result。\n`RestartCameraEvaluation(OriginalTarget,Component)`\n只重试原失败源；GG 源先重建 Stack。\n`UpdateCamera(dt)`／`UpdateCameraPhotographyOnly()`\n非 Running 先返回，保持原生 POV 与时间戳。\nRunning：普通受控 DoUpdate；摄影委托 Super。\n普通发布完整成功才 confirmed；种子无资格。\n[[Camera/结构#发布准入与显式重启|准入与重启]]",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 980,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 350,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "contract",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 状态归属与发布契约\nGA 持有原资源凭证；Hero 持有 Spec＋generation 并消费原 typed H。\nCameraComponent 持有 Offset 单槽 token、碰撞恢复比例及 Stack；Stack 持有模式池／活动栈；ThirdPerson 持本模式侧移／弱来源键，声明期望视角与保护请求；CMC 独占移动事实与资格。\nPrepared 和 Commit 输出只活在单次调用；Manager 的准入／原身份／确认资格不复制持久 POV。\nLocalPlayer 只读取原关联与确认资格，用局部 scratch 运行原生投影并复核；不 Activate／Restart，不持有第二 Cache 或帧调度器。\nNotActivated／Stopped 的两个原生更新入口不写 Cache；Stopped＋confirmed 可继续只读最后有效视图。\n受控 DoUpdate 失败保持两帧原生 POV、时间戳和附加 PP；内部模式进度及任意 Setter／modifier 副作用不承诺整体回滚。\nRunning 摄影入口保持原生 Fill 行为，作用域外 POV setter 仍拒绝发布，时间戳按原生规则处理。\n非法 dt／类／配置／穿透参数明确失败；合法 dt0、半径0、恢复0和混合时间0按正常配置解释。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机覆盖恢复.canvas|覆盖恢复子图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|模式求值子图]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1660,
			"width": 1450,
			"height": 500,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "request",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## FGGYGOCameraPenetrationRequest\n`bEnabled / PivotLocation / ProbeRadius / RecoverySpeed`\n只聚合贡献 > 0 且启用的模式。\nPivot 归一加权；Radius 最大；正速度最小。\n非法参数/聚合算术失败，不归零替代。\n合法 Recovery=0 → 立即恢复。\nCameraComponent 消费聚合请求。",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 1240,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 255,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "pawnext",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\n本地 ASC 身份 Notice（Ready / Refreshed / Released）\n经原 Extension 订阅送至 Hero。\nHero 匹配原订阅/H；只清其所属资源，保护后继。\n宿主/共享 ASC 解绑责任仍由 Extension 持有。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主解绑]]\n[[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|Input 原 H 合同]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1260,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "local-player",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOLocalPlayer\n`GetProjectionData`：核对原 LP/PC/World/Manager。\n`HasConfirmedNativeCameraView()` 才可调用原生投影。\nSuper 只写局部 ProjectionScratch；返回后再次核对。\n成功才写 Out；无关联/未确认/失败保持 Out。\nStopped 若已有确认可继续读取；不触发重启。\n[[System/结构|System]]",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 1380,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "camera-steering-original-cmc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\nMovement 原权威；GetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot()\n→ FGGYGOLocomotionSteeringSnapshot。\n原 OnMovementUpdated 发布已完成物理事实；CMC 判资格、区间有效期及来源换代。\nSnapshot：原 Movement／Character／UpdatedComponent、SourceEpoch、状态／诊断。\nInitial／Valid／NotApplicable／Invalid。\n真实轨迹 ActualSignedVelocityYawRate，bHasVelocityYawRate；胶囊 Yawrate 不替代轨迹。\n合格时同次 GT 读 GetHorizontalVelocityDirection／GetWalkRunBlendAlpha。\n[[Movement/结构|移动权威与接口]]",
			"x": -650,
			"y": 720,
			"width": 470,
			"height": 410,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "camera-mode-observation-contract",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## FGGYGOCameraModeObservation\n原观察消费者 → Component.QueryCameraMode(精确已加载类) const。\nComponent 验 GT／原注册 Owner/World/Stack；\nStack helper 只读原 exact-class pool／active／outer。\n返回 Status、OriginalOwner/Component/Stack/Mode、bInPool/bActive、Diagnostic。\nUnavailable：空身份＋诊断；NotInstantiated：仅原 provenance。\nAvailable：原池对象，active 单独判定；inactive 不读旧开关、不计关闭覆盖。\n不是 POV 发布／正贡献或未来资格；不创建／Push／求值／重建／修改数组访问旗标。\n仅调用局部值，无第二状态／缓存／时钟。\n[[Camera/结构#同次 GT 模式只读观察|消费合同]]\n[[Camera/模式栈实现#同次 GT 查询既有模式|池与 active 查询]]",
			"x": 1580,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 570,
			"color": "4"
		}
	],
	"edges": [
